{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/797067-c20-kithbook-boggan","id":797067,"title":"C20: Kithbook: Boggan","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-30T16:17:53-08:00","id":797067,"title":"C20: Kithbook: Boggan","content":"So if we hit $315,000 on the KS, we'll finally get an official Kithbook: Boggan! Now, that's something I'm really excited about (although the fan-made Kb:Boggan is still pretty good).<br /> <br /> What would you like to see in Kb:Boggan?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T17:44:21-08:00","id":797095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/797067-c20-kithbook-boggan#post797067\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So if we hit $315,000 on the KS, we'll finally get an official Kithbook: Boggan! Now, that's something I'm really excited about (although the fan-made Kb:Boggan is still pretty good).<br /> <br /> What would you like to see in Kb:Boggan?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You know the usual. How they are the secret one True Kith. a New specialized art only they can do that lets them do something other people do but so much better. A world shattering secret that comes off as completely nonsensical but is apparently at the very core at the boggan experience(Like they are secretly Formorians). Oh yeah and a secret secondary Kith that is basically &quot;the most noblest and best Boggans evar&quot; because fuck the Sidhe! A whole bunch of broken Merits some that seem like they are meant for purely peaceful purposes but if you apply them to combat they make boggan murder machines, a single stupid line that can be interpretted that you can use their birthright for assassination.<br /> <br /> /em cough, I appear to have slipped into Pookaese.. sorry about that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T17:58:56-08:00","id":797101,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/797067-c20-kithbook-boggan?p=797095#post797095\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> You know the usual. How they are the secret one True Kith. a New specialized art only they can do that lets them do something other people do but so much better. A world shattering secret that comes off as completely nonsensical but is apparently at the very core at the boggan experience(Like they are secretly Formorians). Oh yeah and a secret secondary Kith that is basically &quot;the most noblest and best Boggans evar&quot; because fuck the Sidhe! A whole bunch of broken Merits some that seem like they are meant for purely peaceful purposes but if you apply them to combat they make boggan murder machines, a single stupid line that can be interpretted that you can use their birthright for assassination.<br /> <br /> /em cough, I appear to have slipped into Pookaese.. sorry about that.</div> </div> </div> </div>LOL! So we'll take that as a list of what not to include.<br /> <br /> I think exploring various archetypes and concepts that go beyond cobblers and homemakers would be useful. The fan kithbook had Boggan gangsters, which was a nice touch. On the surface they seem like they're limited more than other kiths, but I think there's loads of scope there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":5291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","user":"adambeyoncelowe","date":". 12-31-2015, 05:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T18:28:00-08:00","id":797121,"title":"","content":"Yeah that's more or less a list of &quot;Everything I hated about the current Kithbooks&quot; The Sluagh Secret, Redcap merits, so much from the Eshu....<br /> <br /> To me the core of Boggans are they are the Most &quot;commoner&quot; of Kiths. They are the Foundation on which Kithain society rests. They support everyone.. and thus know where all the bodies are buried. They are the Hobbits in Tolkien, the Brave Tailor, They are Puss in Boots(from the fairytale not. Shrek) Alfred to Batman. They are the buffers that you need on raids because they will make everyone better. <br /> <br /> Being a Boggan is about the power and Glory of Service if that make sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-31T02:55:00-08:00","id":797248,"title":"","content":"'The power and glory of service'--I like that!<br /> <br /> Also, post-Accordance War, what would boggan politics be like? The working class over here in Britain has always been proud of its labour, but obviously it became more militant in the 70s with the unions, which Thatcher then broke by the 80s. That had a profound effect on the working class.<br /> <br /> It seems to me that boggans, despite being driven to help, would need and fight for more protections to stop themselves being exploited. They'd be proud of being hard workers, but would want fair treatment as a result. So how would this manifest in Concordia and the Parliament of Dreams?<br /> <br /> I also think there would be a difference between the middle class 'butler' boggans and the working class 'servant' boggans. One wears a suit and helps Batman. The other is a scullery maid. <br /> <br /> Unseelie boggans might not have the same work ethic as their Seelie counterparts: 'I'll do this job for you, because I'm a boggan. But if you screw me over, I'll come round and burn down your freehold in the middle of the night. And I want cash. Now.' Think The Wolf from Pulp Fiction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":5291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","user":"adambeyoncelowe","date":". 12-31-2015, 05:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-31T04:51:48-08:00","id":797275,"title":"","content":"I don't feel that the politics of the working class is a modern issue for the Boggans but rather the core of their dream. As long as people have dreamed of Shinning kings, they have dreamed of someone to respresent the every man, the thing that every king knows he cannot live without. Boggans represent most extremely of all the commoner kiths the governance is a two way street it is not god kings sitting on high but a symbiosis that supreme excecutive power as much derives from the consent of the people as anything else.<br /> <br /> Some legends say when the Shinning Host were born in the Depth of Arcadia each was bound to one special boggan to represent the eternal bond between the ruler and the ruled. The King and the people. It is said all the greatest heroes and villains of the Sidhe can be traced to finding their boggan and the heights they could soar to.<br /> <br /> When the system works Boggans are respected for who they are and what they bring to the table. They get exactly what they deserve, seelie, Unseelie etc.<br /> <br /> Unfortuntely this is the world of darkness so things break down. Other kiths take them for granted not noticing all the quiet little things they get done. Conversely sometimes Boggans forget their core humility seeing themselves as the center of the universe upon which all fae depend they fail to see the needs others bring to their lives. Seelie Boggans know when its time to call in the debts, Unseelie boggans already know where all the bodies are buried and have no problem adding afew.<br /> <br /> When Boggans rule openly rather than as seneschals of noble houses they tend to excel at administration but have difficulty firing up the people luckily they have the right aptitude to bring the right people to solve that situation whether its as simple as an Eshu Troubador or a Troll warrior.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-31T05:05:05-08:00","id":797281,"title":"","content":"I think, especially in light of the Accordance War, class will be an issue for some boggans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-31T15:44:24-08:00","id":797537,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/797067-c20-kithbook-boggan?p=797281#post797281\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think, especially in light of the Accordance War, class will be an issue for some boggans.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's not what I meant, I think class has always been central to the boggan experience. As long as there has been classes boggans have been shaped by them","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T02:22:02-08:00","id":797723,"title":"","content":"I am curious to now if the C20 team will contact Chris Howard, as he was the author who had been chosen to write the KB: Boggans, back then.<br /> <br /> (This is an interested question, since Chris had asked me to contribute to the KB, and I had written an Art, and some Merits and Flaws, as well as a new Background which tried to show how boggans were the fae closest to humans... and, as such, to the source of the Dreaming.)<br /> <br /> Wishful thinking here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3747-mattboggan","name":"mattboggan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T11:06:21-08:00","id":797873,"title":"","content":"I think Chris is out of the business for now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T13:42:15-08:00","id":797952,"title":"","content":"I think he's pretty focused on his art and illustration these days.<br /> <br /> Edit to add: But his work on Changeling is a big influence on me and some of the other new authors. While he's not writing new material, the legacy of what he wrote in Nobles and Denizens I hope can be felt in at least one of my sections.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":648,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","user":"PookaKnight","date":". 01-01-2016, 04:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T17:45:41-08:00","id":798037,"title":"","content":"think we'll get This kithbook I REALLY hope so... never played a boggan... just not my cup of tea... but seems cool....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T00:20:59-08:00","id":798147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/797067-c20-kithbook-boggan?p=797952#post797952\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think he's pretty focused on his art and illustration these days.<br /> <br /> Edit to add: But his work on Changeling is a big influence on me and some of the other new authors. While he's not writing new material, the legacy of what he wrote in Nobles and Denizens I hope can be felt in at least one of my sections.</div> </div> </div> </div>So I take you would be the writer, Julius (or is it Julia? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3747-mattboggan","name":"mattboggan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T00:27:34-08:00","id":798148,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/797067-c20-kithbook-boggan?p=797873#post797873\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think Chris is out of the business for now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, not really. He pulled out of RPG writing a few years ago, being somewhat disgusted after the cancelling of the game line, since he was busy with three different projects (BoG, KB: Boggans, and KttK, not even counting the World of Dreams book that was somehow in discussion).<br /> <br /> Recently, Chris has contacted Onyx Path to know if they would be willing to publish Keys to the Kingdom, as the book was nearly completed (or at least, his chapter set in the Dreaming was).<br /> <br /> So Chris is still here.<br /> <br /> And when you look at his writing for C:tD, it seems to me that he was one of the finest writers for the line (Goblin Town in F&amp;HG, N:tSH, KB: Nockers, DoD, etc.), because he managed to really mix the high fantasy elements with the everyday world (those who know the Cyrrax story that opened KttK would agree, I suppose). That is why, if I were in the shoes of Onyx Path/ Matt (but I know I'm not), I would really try to get him on board.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3747-mattboggan","name":"mattboggan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T03:32:11-08:00","id":798186,"title":"","content":"Keys to the Kingdom would be a great stretch goal. I'm glad Chris is keen to be involved again. I feel like he should've contributed to the new cantrips system, as it still doesn't quite feel right to me (though Unleashing is great).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T05:26:16-08:00","id":798210,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mattboggan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/797067-c20-kithbook-boggan?p=798147#post798147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So I take you would be the writer, Julius (or is it Julia? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />)?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hehehe, yeah, I'm one of them. C20's a huge book, so there are a lot of us working on it. There some familiar names like Ian Lemke, Jackie Cassada, and Nicky Rae, some established White Wolf/Onyx Path folks new to writing on Changeling such as Holden and Maggie, and some total newbies like me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T10:35:01-08:00","id":798313,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/797067-c20-kithbook-boggan?p=798210#post798210\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hehehe, yeah, I'm one of them. C20's a huge book, so there are a lot of us working on it. There some familiar names like Ian Lemke, Jackie Cassada, and Nicky Rae, some established White Wolf/Onyx Path folks new to writing on Changeling such as Holden and Maggie, and some total newbies like me.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\">Since Matt tagged us in his Facebook photo when he printed the first draft I doubt there's a problem with listing us here:<br /> <br /> Peter B Woodworth, Morgan A. McLaughlin McFarland, Amy Veeres, Matthew Dawkins, Vera Vartanian, Christine Beard, Krister M. Michl, Maggie Carroll, Shoshana Kessock, Ian Lemke, Charlie Cantrell, Nicky Rea, Jackie Cassada, Holden Shearer, John Snead and Jonathan McFarland.<br /> <br /> Edit: I forgot to add Nicky to the list.</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Krister M. Michl</b> <hr /><b>Freelance writer</b> <hr /><a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Krister_M._Michl\" target=\"_blank\">Entry on White Wolf Wikipedia</a>","edited":{"userid":2494,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2494-rigistrade","user":"Rigistrade","date":". 01-02-2016, 05:11 